# Cleanup round fix1 (docs/DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md §32), flow "fix1_shop" (Ortaocak; at 1280x720,
# 1920x1080 and 1024x640 @150 %): with a shop open the shop sits left and the inventory right, and the camera
# frames the merchant in the gap between them (on 960x600 logical both sit low and the merchant is framed
# above them); the greeting is italic; pickup lines have one format for sales, purchases and loot
# ("+10 Akçe", "+1 Kızılca Şerbet"); a stock longer than the window scrolls (wheel, scrollbar; the long stock
# is a client-only test hook, `scene shopfakestock`); opening the Künye beside the shop pair closes the less recently used
# window of the pair instead of covering it. (The drink gesture runs in the shop / two_clients_shop flows' ITEM_USED.)
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text fix1_shop
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Pazarli
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+npcs2+npcanimated 1800
waitfor world+nobanner 400
# ---- The smith: a sale adds "+10 Akçe" (the pickup line) beside the shop's own line ----
scene talk Demirci Ilgaz
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene expectnooverlap
rclickon inv.bag.0
waitfor world+sold1+shopidle 600
scene expectshopmessage Ocak Baltası satıldı (+10 Akçe).
scene expectpickup +10 Akçe
key escape
wait 3
expect world+shopclosed+invclosed
# ---- The potion seller: the merchant stays in view between / above the two windows ----
scene walktonpc Sürmeli Bacı 3
waitfor world+nodest+standing 900
scene talk Sürmeli Bacı
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 600
scene camera at:Sürmeli_Bacı@20 18 7
waitfor world+merchantvisible 180
wait 30
# (M15: six potions; on 960x600 logical the list scrolls, so no shopnoscroll here)
expect world+merchantvisible+greetingitalic
scene expectnooverlap
expecttext shop.greeting Yolun açık olsun
move 2 2
wait 3
screenshot ui_20_shop_merchant_visible.png
# A purchase: "+1 Kızılca Şerbet" (the loot format).
clickon shop.item.16
waitfor world+modal+quantitybox 120
key enter
waitfor world+bought1+shopidle 600
scene expectshopmessage Kızılca Şerbet alındı (8 Akçe).
scene expectpickup +1 Kızılca Şerbet
move 2 2
wait 3
screenshot ui_21_purchase_pickup_line.png
# ---- A long stock (test hook): the list scrolls ----
scene shopfakestock 15
waitfor world+shopscrolls 60
expect world+shopfirst0
scene expectnooverlap
# The merchant (head and marker) stays in view with the long stock too (960x600: the shop is no taller
# than the inventory, the pair sits low, the merchant is framed above).
waitfor world+merchantvisible 120
wait 20
expect world+merchantvisible
screenshot ui_22_long_stock.png
hoveron shop.window
wheel -3
wait 3
expect world+shopfirst3+merchantvisible
screenshot ui_23_long_stock_scrolled.png
wheel 1
wait 3
expect world+shopfirst2
scene shopscroll 99
wait 3
expect world+shopscrolls
move 2 2
wait 3
screenshot ui_24_long_stock_end.png
scene shopscroll 0
wait 3
expect world+shopfirst0
# ---- The Künye beside the shop pair: no room for three: the least recently used in its way closes (1280: the shop;
# 960x600: the inventory, the shop was clicked after it opened); nothing overlaps ----
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
wait 3
scene expectnooverlap
expect world+winclosed1
screenshot ui_25_kunye_with_shop.png
scene closewindows
wait 3
scene shoplog
quit
